<title>USA: Hovnanian Enterprises Inc Q3 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Hovnanian Enterprises Inc Q3 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>RED BANK, N.J. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended July 31.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.13		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			  3,110		    2,085</p>
<p> Revs		     195,812		  173,153</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,037		   23,037</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net			  4,858		    3,498</p>
<p> Revs		     465,415		  446,033</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,037		   23,030</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Contract backlog as of July 31: $386.5 million (2,128 homes) vs $407.3 million (2,259 homes).</p>
<p>Q3 net contracts $163.2 million vs $175.3 million.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 and nine month periods include an inventory impairment loss of $559,000.</p>
